  "description": "The Numove 200 FE takes everything we know about building great, versatile bikes, scaled perfectly to fit younger riders – and with a full set of touring accessories so it's ready for any two-wheeled adventure. With handlebars, grips and brake levers proportioned specifically for smaller hands, it has easy and safe handling. There's an adjustable CUBE stem to help fine-tune the bike's fit as your child grows. Easy-to-use 8-speed gears are similar to the ones on mum or dad's bike. We fitted a luggage rack, mudguards, lights and a kickstand, too. And grippy tyres on lightweight wheels finish things off, for a bike that your child will love.",
